# Ensure all prerequisite dependencies (e.g. retrieved skills, data (preference)

Standing user preference: Ensure all prerequisite dependencies (e.g. retrieved skills, data, or components) exist before executing a task that depends on them; do not run a task that asserts efficacy against resources that do not yet exist.

## Conventions
- Ensure all prerequisite dependencies (e.g. retrieved skills, data, or components) exist before executing a task that depends on them; do not run a task that asserts efficacy against resources that do not yet exist.

